["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nik Storonsky: The most uncompromising banking CEO K-factor NPAP (New Product Approval Process) OCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-cheekypint-revolut-ceo-把银行信贷类比卖期权-收十年租金-一年亏光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9d2ccbd206c41a7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Revolut CEO 把银行信贷类比卖期权：收十年租金，一年亏光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放贷利润会被经济周期一次性抹平，所以 Revolut 把放贷目标压到资产负债表不到10%、其余证券化出表，宁可做订阅制科技公司，也不做传统净息差银行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新型银行</span><span class=\"tag\">产品运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shadi Hamid and Matthew Kaemingk on Whether Democracy Needs Religion idolatry political hobbyism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-goodfight-政治变得越世俗-反而越像一场圣战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>政治变得越世俗，反而越像一场圣战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两位作者认为，当人们不再从宗教获得身份认同与终极意义，这种渴望并未消失，而是转移进了政治——这正是美国政治走向「圣战化」的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教与政治</span><span class=\"tag\">政党政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Elon Musk Solves Problems | Jon McNeill battlefield promotion bill of materials weighted ETF Follow Me Home exercise Fire Yourself exercise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-knowledge-马斯克的产品算法-自动化是最后一步-不是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/586a4f39f9c67632-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克的产品算法：自动化是最后一步，不是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉团队曾因为先自动化而在同一个问题上卡住数月：马斯克的算法要求先删需求、简化流程、手动跑通，自动化永远是最后一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span><span class=\"tag\">马斯克</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"515 从铁幕创作到解冻文艺：漫谈世界电影史中的波兰巨匠安杰伊·瓦伊达 Zespół filmowy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-cn2aa250-波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的-没进戛纳就等于没拍过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的：没进戛纳就等于没拍过</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者说大卫·波德威尔写罗马尼亚电影史时一个字都没提，不是因为片子差，而是因为那些片子从没被送到西方能看见的电影节。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">波兰电影</span><span class=\"tag\">冷战文化政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Perfectly Leveraged for the Squat progressive overload majestic womanhood manhood stones Title IX\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-ninepi-被遗忘的维多利亚大力女明星-当年体重大才被认为又强又美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">35:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>被遗忘的维多利亚大力女明星：当年体重大才被认为又强又美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现代人以瘦为美的观念只有一百多年历史——维多利亚时代的马戏团大力女星体重两百磅，却被封为「世界上最强壮也最美丽的女人」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性力量史</span><span class=\"tag\">举重</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How college football&#x27;s deadliest year built the NCAA flying wedge mass momentum play NIL death harvest\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-throughline-老罗斯福不是ncaa诞生的真正推手-一场校园死亡才是导火索/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>老罗斯福不是NCAA诞生的真正推手，一场校园死亡才是导火索</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1905年「死亡丰收年」后，真正催生NCAA新规则委员会的不是老罗斯福的三校会议，而是NYU校长绕开大三校另起炉灶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育史</span><span class=\"tag\">NCAA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 227 Carbon Monoxide: Haunted houses &amp; coal mine canaries carboxyhemoglobin hyperbaric oxygen\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-tpwky-历史上许多-闹鬼事件-其实是一氧化碳中毒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>历史上许多「闹鬼事件」,其实是一氧化碳中毒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一氧化碳不仅抢着跟血红蛋白结合，还让已经结合的氧气释放不出来——这种双重机制造成的症状太诡异，历史上常被诊断成闹鬼或精神病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">毒理学</span><span class=\"tag\">医学史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"297: Why Teens Lie—and How to Respond Without Escalating Haim Ginott smell test perspective game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-asklisa-心理学家-教孩子对同伴撒谎自保-好过逞强说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fae74bb25cb36023-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>心理学家：教孩子对同伴撒谎自保，好过逞强说真话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">面对同伴怂恿抽大麻之类的场合，她宁可教孩子说一句谎把责任推给父母脱身，也不要孩子因找不到体面拒绝方式而冒险——目标是安全优先，不是诚实至上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年教育</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Loud, Messy, Physical - What To Do When Kids Won&#x27;t Stop Fighting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-unruffled-孩子打架别急着拉开-冲突本身就是他们在学社交/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打架别急着拉开：冲突本身就是他们在学社交</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">频繁的尖叫、撕咬甚至打你一巴掌，往往不是孩子出了问题，而是父母越介入，冲突就越容易变成孩子们抢夺「妈妈注意力」的戏码。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子教育</span><span class=\"tag\">手足冲突</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E258｜聊聊硅谷创业“修道院”HF0与OpenRouter早期故事 spray and pray subtraction Demo Dinner unified interface for LLMs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-sv101-以为硅谷孵化器教的是增长黑客-学到的却是只做一件事的减法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">54:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>以为硅谷孵化器教的是增长黑客，学到的却是只做一件事的减法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人说最难的减法不是去掉不重要的娱乐，而是只盯住对公司最重要的那件事，甚至排除掉第二重要的事情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">HF0</span><span class=\"tag\">孵化器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"151 ✪ 从「需要」到「想要」：中国时尚品牌集体向上 lookbook intangible assets\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-fengtouquan-消费降级论被打脸-千元档国货时尚品牌增速是大盘六倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"疯\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">疯投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>消费降级论被打脸：千元档国货时尚品牌增速是大盘六倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天猫数据显示，客单价1500至2000元的轻奢价位国货品牌，今年成交增速是整个服装电商大盘的六倍，消费者正在为向往感而非性价比买单。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">时尚品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">电商经营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"512 – Oops, All Henrys exchequer investiture controversy homage mark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-britishhist-把6岁女儿嫁给未来皇帝-英格兰国库的第一笔开支是联姻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>把6岁女儿嫁给未来皇帝：英格兰国库的第一笔开支是联姻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利把6岁的女儿许配给靠软禁父亲上位的德意志国王，为此开出的一万马克聘金，与鲁弗斯当年卖掉整个诺曼底公国的价码完全相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">王室联姻</span><span class=\"tag\">封建效忠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen and His Spy Romeo Entity List\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-商务部明知英伟达合作方由中国间谍操控-仍放行48亿美元芯片/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/19b361072bd3e2fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>商务部明知英伟达合作方由中国间谍操控，仍放行48亿美元芯片</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商务部早已掌握Megaspeed由中国间谍运营的情报，仍选择不执行本可阻断其芯片供应的既有规定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Frontier Labs Buy: A Data Deep Dive with Handshake AI — Garrett Lord &amp; Team RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) reward hacking redlining Care Bench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-latentspace-银行家宁可从零重做-也不愿修改ai给出的95-正确答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1b6b68e7fa0afc2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>银行家宁可从零重做，也不愿修改AI给出的95%正确答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修复一个95%正确的AI输出，花的时间和从零开始一样多，因为错误藏在公式与判断的细节里，而非表层格式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据标注</span><span class=\"tag\">金融建模</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anne of Brittany proxy marriage book of hours Estates of Brittany\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-stuffmissed-安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国-死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国，死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安妮一生三次嫁人、两次加冕法国王后，用婚姻条款逼法国承认布列塔尼的独立地位，但她死后国王还是违背她的遗愿，把布列塔尼并入了法国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治联姻</span><span class=\"tag\">布列塔尼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scott Kupor on Building a16z and Rebuilding the Federal Workforce OPM GS-14 permissioned risk time-in-grade phalanx\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-a16z-美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">退休申请走完所有流程后，纸质件要被送进宾夕法尼亚一座废弃石灰岩矿洞人工归档——卡住它的不是技术，是没人愿意为改善系统去承担被国会问责的风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Retelling history in art and drama Joint Stock corpsing Boko Haram\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-startweek-今天的英国剧场比1970年代更保守-不是更开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>今天的英国剧场比1970年代更保守，不是更开放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">《云的九种形态》导演坦言：如今英国新剧远比1970年代更拘谨，复排时特意将后半段处理成一出年代戏，因为那种坦率尺度已经回不去了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殖民历史</span><span class=\"tag\">戏剧改编</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"宏观经济如何传导给我们每个人？ R&lt;G convenience yield paradox of thrift negative beta\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-mianji-这轮全球失衡不是宏观问题-根源是ai资本开支狂潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/df0264fae5d8abe9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"面\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">面基</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>这轮全球失衡不是宏观问题，根源是AI资本开支狂潮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国扩大AI资本开支推高投资、股市繁荣拉动消费，储蓄降、投资升，这才是本轮全球失衡加剧的真正驱动力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观经济</span><span class=\"tag\">美债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"This Is How New York City Takes Out Its Trash Empire bin ASL truck Defensible Space\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-oddlots-纽约收垃圾没有现成卡车可用-政府花10个月自己设计了一辆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>纽约收垃圾没有现成卡车可用：政府花10个月自己设计了一辆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为没有适合纽约街道的自动侧装卡车，抄欧洲方案又要等五年，纽约市环卫局干脆亲自下场把车设计出来，只用了十个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市治理</span><span class=\"tag\">垃圾处理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#415 ‒ AMA #91: Understanding lab testing: what blood work can and cannot tell you about your health and disease risk DTC testing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-thepeterattiad-血检再全面-也只能揭示两到三成的健康风险全貌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>血检再全面，也只能揭示两到三成的健康风险全貌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Peter Attia在这期AMA里给出一个具体数字：即便是最全面的血液检测，也只能提供他评估患者风险所需信息的25%到30%，剩下的需要靠影像、体成分和纵向追踪补齐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">血液检测</span><span class=\"tag\">健康风险评估</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Are We Cooking!? What Should Dems Do Next + Jensen&#x27;s Affair MSS MATCH Act Section 232 USMCA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-得州州长选举爆冷-反数据中心情绪一夜抹去近万亿美元市值/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ba219ec92b9bc66-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>得州州长选举爆冷，反数据中心情绪一夜抹去近万亿美元市值</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">反数据中心情绪从来不是「自由派恨科技」的故事，而是跨党派共识，已经强到能掀翻一场州长选举、让华尔街措手不及地蒸发巨额市值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Deep Dive on Submarines X-Craft bathyscaphe SSN\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-historyhit-击沉贝尔格拉诺号前-副艇长曾当众喝止艇长的开火令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6775897482174464-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">51:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>击沉贝尔格拉诺号前，副艇长曾当众喝止艇长的开火令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">核潜艇「征服者」号击沉阿根廷巡洋舰贝尔格拉诺号前，副指挥官麦克莱蒙曾在控制室喝止艇长，只为等一个更好的射击角度——那是英国潜艇自二战以来首次真正开火。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">潜艇史</span><span class=\"tag\">二战海战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"721. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Outbreak of The Crimean War (Part 1) sublime port plunger cavalry drawl black bottle affair sick man of Europe\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-restishistory-克里米亚战争真正的导火索-只是伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/607aa1e9567d043b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>克里米亚战争真正的导火索，只是伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">克里米亚战争由伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争点燃，英法俄三大国在互相猜忌和误判中，像后来的一战列强一样梦游般卷入了这场冲突。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亚战争</span><span class=\"tag\">维多利亚时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Cisco Got Bullwhipped Bullwhip effect Virtual close Extranet Keiretsu Vendor financing Contract manufacturer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-asianometry-思科自夸能实时看清全球需求-其实看到的是客户重复下的订单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">A</div><span class=\"dur\">31:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>思科自夸能实时看清全球需求，其实看到的是客户重复下的订单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">思科两个季度库存分别暴涨87%和58.8%，根源不是需求爆发，而是客户为抢缺货重复下单，又被「实时供应链」原样放大转发给了上游。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">供应链管理</span><span class=\"tag\">牛鞭效应</span>\n</div></div></a>"]